    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳想知道我在做什麼？\n我在餵野生的可可多拉吃飯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B360F377E5905362115728505A4EC09EBCFF1F000A62115728993591CE751F768453EF53EF591A62C9540398EF3002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可可多拉最愛吃的是鐵，要是任牠去覓食，\n牠就會連車子之類的都吃掉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF53EF591A62C96700611B54037684662F9435FF0C8981662F4EFB726053BB899398DFFF0C000A72605C31670390238ECA5B504E4B985E768490FD540363893002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我才會像這樣餵牠們吃鐵屑，\n以免牠們跑去吃下不該吃的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE56211624D670350CF90196A23993572605011540394355C51FF0C000A4EE5514D726050118DD153BB54034E0B4E0D8A72540376843002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但餐餐都吃鐵屑的話，\n我有點擔心可可多拉牠們會吃膩了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F469910991090FD540394355C5176848A71FF0C000A621167099EDE64D45FC353EF53EF591A62C9726050116703540381A94E863002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是我想到了一招。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F621160F352304E864E0062DB3002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用毒屬性的招式幫鐵屑加上風味\n應該會很不錯，對吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75286BD25C6C6027768462DB5F0F5E6B94355C5152A04E0A98A85473000A61C98A7267035F884E0D932FFF0C5C0D5427FF01001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且鋼屬性的寶可夢\n也沒什麼好怕毒的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1492FC5C6C602776845BF653EF5922000A4E5F6C924EC09EBC597D60156BD276843002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳試著對鐵屑使出招式<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>污泥炸彈<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，\n幫鐵屑調味看看吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
